# Never committed: VITE_API_URL and anything else environment-specific.
# Vite bakes these into the build at build time, so the wrong value here
# doesn't fail loudly — it ships a production bundle quietly calling
# localhost from every visitor's browser.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

